  <h1>List Your Business on Torilu</h1>
  <p>For restaurant and cafe owners in Bahrain: a clear menu in Arabic and English, in your own style. A digital page that opens with a scan and sends orders to your WhatsApp, a phone and story version, and a print-ready version.</p>
</section>
<details class="biz-owners" id="owners">
  <summary>Is your place on Torilu? Why and how</summary>
  <p><b>Why is your place here?</b> Because people search for it, and I want them to find it with correct information. Being listed on Torilu is free.</p>
  <p><b>Why didn't I ask first?</b> Everything I show is information your business published itself so people can find it: name, location, hours, business phone and prices. I bring it together in one place, as maps and directories do, and I'm always glad to hear from you.</p>
  <p><b>What I never do:</b> I don't copy your photos, logo or menu design, I don't publish personal numbers, I don't invent information, and nobody can buy a higher spot in search.</p>
  <p><b>How do I check?</b> I visit places myself and take every detail from its official source: the business's own account, website or phone, or a recent map.</p>
  <p class="biz-owners-stamp"><img src="{{ '/assets/stamp-liked.svg' | url }}" alt="" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy" /><span><b>The "Recommended" stamp:</b> a place only gets it when I genuinely liked it, and it appears on its Torilu page next to my own words about it.</span></p>
  <p><b>What's free and what's paid?</b> Your listing and the plain list of your items on its page are free. The digital menu designed in your shop's style and its print version are a paid service; just ask me.</p>
  <div class="hm-demos"><a class="btn" href="{{ '/en/contact.html' | url }}?owner=correct">Correct your place's info</a><a class="btn secondary" href="{{ '/en/contact.html' | url }}?owner=remove">Ask to remove your place</a></div>
  <p class="biz-note">Anyone who spots a mistake can use the correction button too. Before any change or removal, I confirm with the business itself through the phone number or official Instagram shown on its Torilu page, not the number typed in the form, so nobody can change a place that isn't theirs.</p>
</details>
